# AtCoder Library Practice Contest A - Disjoint Set Union
# https://atcoder.jp/contests/practice2/tasks/practice2_a

Kalivisku musope kas root vis parent kasta x {
    Pilike palusta parent[x] != x {
        Kemese kas parent[x] tas parent[parent[x]].
        Kemese kas x tas parent[x].
    }
    Jasepe kas x.
}

Sonome kas N kasta Q tas Kisite kas readints vis 2.
Sonome kas parent tas [i Pilike kas i pas (Kisite kas pilika vis N)].
Sonome kas size tas Kisite kas fill vis 1 kasta N.
Sonome kas query tas [0, 0, 0].
Sonome kas ru tas 0.
Sonome kas rv tas 0.

Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis Q {
    Kemese kas query tas Kisite kas readints vis 3.
    Kemese kas ru tas Kisite kas root vis parent kasta query[1].
    Kemese kas rv tas Kisite kas root vis parent kasta query[2].

    Palusta query[0] kate 0 {
        Palusta ru != rv {
            Palusta size[ru] < size[rv] {
                Kemese kas parent[ru] tas rv.
                size[rv] += size[ru].
            } Japalusta {
                Kemese kas parent[rv] tas ru.
                size[ru] += size[rv].
            }
        }
    } Japalusta {
        Palusta ru kate rv {
            Takute kas 1.
        } Japalusta {
            Takute kas 0.
        }
    }
}
